## Summary

| Severity | Count | Top Issue |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| 🔴 Critical | 3 | Triple-regex chain in `Underscore()` — 4+ allocs/call × millions |
| 🟡 Moderate | 4 | Per-instance `Compiled` regex in `InflectionRule`, double execution |
| ℹ️ Info | 1 | Unsealed class |

**Highest-impact fix:** Replacing `Underscore()` with a single-pass `StringBuilder` approach eliminates 3 regex executions + 4 string allocations per call. Since `Kebaberize()` delegates to `Underscore()`, this fix also accelerates kebab-case conversion.

